-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/940965-mortal-cultists-of-the-dark-mother?p=966745#post966745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This topic is getting coverage in the PG, by the way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooooooh, now I'm really excited for it. I understand if it's too early to say, but will we get any fully fleshed out Mystery Cults in that book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T13:33:28-07:00","id":968118,"title":"","content":"The fact that we can have this conversation is, to me, a reason why I so dearly loves <b>Beast: the Primordial</b>. That is, we are given wonderful tools to play the game 'as she is written', but we ALSO can add to it in ways that send it off into all manner of directions on account of how well its crossover potential allows us to 'borrow' (read: steal!) notions and mechanics from other CofD lines, all in the name of being part of <b>Beast</b>.<br /> <br /> Oh, and THEN good old <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt\">blackhatmatt</a></b> has to post something like:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bl